                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: What happens when someone is dead?\nWhen someone is dead, their body no longer functions and they are no longer alive.\n\nStep 2: What are some things that happen when someone is alive?\nWhen someone is alive, they move, work, and breathe.\n\nStep 3: What does someone stop doing when being dead?\nBased on the information from steps 1 and 2, we can conclude that someone stops being alive when they are dead. Therefore, the answer is D) alive.",
