                        "cot_trigger": "kojima-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "CSF is the fluid that surrounds the brain and spinal cord. Increased cerebrospinal fluid protein with normal cell count is a normal finding. Oligoclonal bands are a sign of a bacterial infection. The final answer: E.",
