                        "cot_trigger": "lievin-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's derive the differential diagnosis step by step.\n\n1) The patient has thalassemia intermedia, which is a blood disorder characterized by decreased production of hemoglobin.\n\n2) The patient has a mutation in the Kozak sequence of the Beta-globin gene, which decreases, though does not abolish, translation of the Beta-globin mRNA.\n\n3) The patient's blood smear would be expected to show macrocytic red blood cells.",
