o detect viral infections, which could be a possible cause of the infant's symptoms. However, there is no specific indication for this test based on the information provided.\nE) T-cell receptor excision circle analysis: This test is used to evaluate the function of the immune system and is not likely to be helpful in diagnosing the infant's current symptoms.\n\nThe most appropriate answer is D) Polymerase",
