patient, as it can improve mood and concentration. However, it may also cause insomnia and agitation, which could worsen her symptoms.\n\nBased on the above analysis, the medication that should be most avoided in this patient is D) Mirtazapine, as it may worsen her binge eating behavior and cause weight gain. The other medications may have some potential side effects, but they are not as likely to trigger",
