                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "B) Fractional tissue oxygen extraction is decreased in this patient compared to a healthy adult.\nFractional tissue oxygen extraction (FTO2) is the amount of oxygen extracted from the blood by the tissues. It is a measure of the oxygen delivery to the tissues and is decreased in this patient compared to a healthy adult.\nThe correct answer is B) Fractional tissue oxygen extraction.",
