as menopause or a family history of the condition. \n\nTherefore, the potential complication that could occur in this patient is B) Endometrial cancer. The patient is taking tamoxifen and has not had a hysterectomy, which increases her risk of endometrial cancer. She should be monitored closely for any signs or symptoms of this condition during",
