                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's derive the differential diagnosis step by step. \n\nThe patient has back pain that is worse after moving furniture and improved when riding a bike or pushing a cart. This suggests that the pain is mechanical in nature.\n\nThe patient also has numbness and weakness in his legs when he walks. This suggests that the pain is radicular in nature.\n\nThe most likely diagnosis is a herniated nucleus pulposus.",
