                        "cot": " The patient has increased tiredness and lethargy, a low hemoglobin level, and a high creatinine level. The serum is negative for ANA and positive for C3 nephritic factor. Urinalysis shows a 3+ proteinuria. The renal biopsy demonstrates hypercellular glomerulus with electron dense deposits along the glomerular basement membrane. The most likely cause is Poststreptococcal glomerulonephritis (PSGN).",
