                        "cot_trigger": "lievin-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's derive the differential diagnosis step by step: \n\n1. The most likely mechanism of antibiotic resistance in the surviving colony is a mutation of DNA gyrase.\n\n2. Inactivation by bacterial transferase is a less likely mechanism of antibiotic resistance in the surviving colony.\n\n3. Modification of surface binding proteins is a less likely mechanism of antibiotic resistance in the surviving colony.",
