                        "cot": "Let's use step by step inductive reasoning, given the medical nature of the question. \n\nThe first thing to note is that the surviving colony is resistant to ciprofloxacin. Ciprofloxacin is a fluoroquinolone antibiotic. This class of antibiotics works by inhibiting the bacterial enzyme, DNA gyrase. \n\nThe most likely mechanism of antibiotic resistance in the surviving colony is a mutation of DNA gyrase.",
