                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's think step by step. This patient is in preterm labor, so we want to give a tocolytic. A tocolytic is a medication used to stop or slow preterm labor. Betamethasone is a steroid that is given to stimulate the fetal cells. The steroid will help the baby's lungs to mature.",
