                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe man's actions are most consistent with which of the following psychological defense mechanisms? Reaction formation.\n\nExplanation:\nReaction formation is a psychological defense mechanism where a person adopts a contrary opinion to a repressed impulse.",
