                        "cot": "Let's differentiate using step by step reasoning like a medical expert. \n\nFirst, the patient is diagnosed with diabetes. The most likely form of diabetes is type 2 diabetes.\n\nType 2 diabetes is associated with obesity, insulin resistance, and dyslipidemia.\n\nThe patient is obese (BMI 32) and has insulin resistance.\n\nThe patient also has dyslipidemia.\n\nThe patient's most likely form of diabetes is type 2 diabetes.",
