                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's use step by step inductive reasoning, given the medical nature of the question. \n\nThe first thing we know is that the patient is 63 years old. The second thing we know is that the patient has been slowly gaining weight over the past 6 months, despite attempts to diet and exercise. The third thing we know is that the patient has an abnormal fasting blood glucose. The fourth thing we know is that the patient has been diagnosed with diabetes. \n\nThe most likely form of diabetes for this patient is type 2 diabetes. Type 2 diabetes is associated with obesity, insulin resistance, and a family history of diabetes.",
