                                "answer": "C) Avoidant personality disorder. The daughter's behavior is consistent with the symptoms of avoidant personality disorder, which include social isolation, fear of rejection, and extreme sensitivity to criticism. The daughter's reluctance to participate in extracurricular activities and her belief that nobody wants to be friends with her are also characteristic of avoidant personality disorder.",
