                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "we need to correct the spelling of \"aeriole\" to \"arteriole.\" The answer is A) The oncotic pressure of the fluid leaving the capillaries is less than that of fluid entering it. The oncotic pressure of the fluid leaving the glomerular capillaries is actually higher than that of the fluid entering it, due to the selective filtration of proteins and other large molecules.",
                        "answers": [
