                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " Dapsone is used for treatment of bacterial and fungal infections. Bacterial and fungal infections are caused by microorganisms, so the mechanism of dapsone must be related to the microorganism. Dapsone is also used for immunomodulatory actions, so the mechanism must be related to the immune system.\n\nAnswer: B) Inhibition of ergosterol in cell membranes",
