                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Dapsone is used for treatment of bacterial and fungal infections as well as for immunomodulatory actions. Dapsone is an anti-infective drug with immunomodulatory actions. It is used to treat dermatitis herpetiformis and leprosy. It is also used to treat certain autoimmune diseases such as lupus erythematosus and dermatitis.\nDapsone is an anti-infective drug with immunomodulatory actions. It is used to treat dermatitis herpetiformis and leprosy. It is also used to treat certain autoimmune diseases such as lupus erythematosus and dermatitis.",
