                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nDapsone is a sulfone with a sulfonyl group, which is a good leaving group. It is also structurally similar to PABA, so it can compete with PABA for the enzyme dihydrofolate reductase, which is part of the folic acid synthesis pathway.\nDapsone is an inhibitor of dihydrofolate reductase, so it competes with PABA for the enzyme dihydrofolate reductase, which is part of the folic acid synthesis pathway.",
