                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\n1) What does jaundice indicate?\n\nJaundice indicates that there is an excess of bilirubin in the blood.\n\n2) What are the possible causes of an excess of bilirubin in the blood?\n\nThere are many possible causes of an excess of bilirubin in the blood, including liver disease, hemolytic anemia, and certain medications.\n\n3) In this particular case, what is the most likely cause of the excess bilirubin?\n\nThe most likely cause of the excess bilirubin in this case is Gilbert syndrome.",
